{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13217920","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13217920","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1321792001:0":{"text":"あ、あなたは。応接間にいたメイドさん！","source_cn":"你……你是刚才那个在会客室里的侍女！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC34316B8610CDB51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321792002:0":{"text":"応接間？私が応接間に……？","source_cn":"会客室……？我去过会客室吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9E9441BEF12EF25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321792003:1":{"text":"……あ！少し思い出してきました。確か、何か楽しいことが……いえ、悲しいことだったような？","source_cn":"……啊！好像模模糊糊有些印象，是很快乐的事情。不……是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD380B8090067485A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321792004:0":{"text":"どういうことかしら……自分の考えていることが分からないなんて。大変失礼いたしました。","source_cn":"哎呀，真奇怪……我竟然搞不清楚自己到底在想什么，真是失礼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6770AF32FCB62014","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321792005:0":{"text":"どうやら幻境が消えて、お城の人たちも今までの事をほとんど忘れてしまったみたいですね。","source_cn":"看来幻境消失后，城堡里的人也忘记了发生的事呢，只留下一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F247D0207C7A490","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321792006:1":{"text":"ファティラさん。もう一人の方と一緒に、リアさんが姫様のご遺体を清めるのを手伝ってくれますか？","source_cn":"法蒂玛，你带人去寝殿里协助莉娅女士……为公主殿下清理遗体。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x528E18673CDC1736","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321792007:1":{"text":"姫様の……","source_cn":"公主殿下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x545A6CE0341FBB91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321792008:1":{"text":"分かりました。すぐに行きます……","source_cn":"是，罗德里戈大人……我这就带人进去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F68B9AFBA0FABF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:侍女法蒂玛":{"text":"メイドのファティラ","source":"侍女法蒂玛","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:侍卫长罗德里戈":{"text":"護衛隊長のロドリゴ","source":"侍卫长罗德里戈","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":4}}